OL,3,AOpenAI gives cyber defence tools to
OL,4,AUkraine
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe tech giant OpenAI will share its AI
OL,7,Fcyber defence system Daybreak for free
OL,8,Fwith the Ukraine government to help it
OL,9,Fprotect civilian infrastructure, like
OL,10,Fhospitals and power plants, from
OL,11,Fcyber-attacks.
OL,13,FAccording to the Computer Emergency
OL,14,FResponse Team of Ukraine (CERT-UA), the
OL,15,Fnational cyber incident response team,
OL,16,FUkraine recorded nearly 6,000 attacks
OL,17,Fin 2025.
OL,19,FDaybreak is able to quickly identify
OL,20,Fweaknesses in digital systems and help
OL,21,Fdevelop fixes.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,116,105,200,160,0,100
